:: garden {"position":"700,825"}
<<scenery garden>>
You are currently standing in your garden.
<<unlessEmergency>>\
    <<wanderingSlaves>>\
    <<keyOption [[Leave your garden|main]] 🚪>>
    <<keyAction 'gardening' 🌺>><<addMinutes 30>><<run Engine.show()>><</keyAction>>: 30min
    <<sleepOption>>
    <<set _wandering = Person.getWandering()>>
    <<if _wandering.length == 1>>
        <<keyAction "Perhaps the slave could help with the garden?"  >>
            <<openNpcInteraction gardenHelper _wandering[0].uid>>
        <</keyAction>>
    <</if>>
<</unlessEmergency>>\